<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Georgia-Pacific raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Georgia-Pacific raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers analyst James Flicker said he upgraded Georgia-Pacific Corp to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- cited cheap stock price.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target of $85.</p>
<p>-- shares closed down one point at 71-1/4 on Thursday.</p>
</text>
